                                                "sense_id": "0f28fa80-ce6c-35fe-bf35-4c54e3ce0b3a",
                                                "text": "all of these services, including mSpy, function with the same kind of predatory subscription scheme, luring you in with free trials that autorenew as abhorrently expensive monthly or yearly subscriptions. canceling the service requires reaching out to support, so users are typically unable to avoid overrunning the trial."
